      "value": "I will refuse to age verify for as long as Persona is used as the company. I don't them trust their word with Peter Thiel as a shareholder. VRChat, PLEASE pick another vendor, preferably from the EU where there's actual solid privacy protection laws and where the nation hasn't gone insane for the last few weeks. Frankly, I don't think any US data company can be trusted at this time. Thanks.",
